# WalletConnect project ID (free, from https://cloud.reown.com).
# Needed ONLY for EVM (Ethereum / BNB Chain) wallet connections.
# Tron (TronLink) and Solana (Phantom / Solflare) work without it.
# Get one: cloud.reown.com → Projects → Create Project → AppKit → Next.js.
# Never commit a real value here — put it in .env.local (gitignored) and in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
